# Card Database (DBV), card tables, and deck editor table CSS

- **database-view.css**: Card database view shell (`#database-view`) — tabs, stats, layout, shared DB chrome. Not deck editor Card View.
- **card-tables.css**: Card database **tables** only — column widths, header filters, checkbox filter chrome. Not deck editor Card View.
- **deck-editor-card-view.css**: Deck editor **Card View** only (`.deck-cards-editor.card-view`). Loaded after `card-tables.css`, before `mobile-layout.css`. Do not conflate with deck selection tiles (different CSS).
- **Card View** (`.deck-cards-editor.card-view`): Each card is a `.deck-card-card-view-item` with `data-type` and `data-orientation`. **Orientation rule:** only character, location, and event are landscape; all other types are portrait. **Do not regress:** see [docs/current/DECK_EDITOR_CARD_VIEW_LAYOUT.md](../../docs/current/DECK_EDITOR_CARD_VIEW_LAYOUT.md).
  - **Landscape** (character, location, event) — **reusable layout:** Card item and `.card-foil-img-wrap` have **no visible frame** (border: none, background: transparent, outline: none, box-shadow: none). Image fills wrap edge-to-edge with **bevelled corners** (border-radius: 8px on wrap and images). `.card-view-actions` in flow **below** the image with padding. Same CSS block for all three; only wrap height differs by type. Do not add border/background to item or wrap.
  - **Portrait** (mission, special, aspect, power, etc.): Image fills frame; `.card-view-actions` **below** the frame (`position: absolute`, `bottom: -35px`).
- Exact dimensions and breakpoints: [docs/current/STYLE_GUIDE.md](../../docs/current/STYLE_GUIDE.md) (Deck Editor Card View Styling).
- **Two-layer progressive load** (card-view and hover modal): Thumb + full-res are stacked; full-res fades in via `--loaded` class. [docs/current/PROGRESSIVE_IMAGE_LOADING.md](../../docs/current/PROGRESSIVE_IMAGE_LOADING.md).
- **Character Stacks Available Cards styles**:
  - Uses existing available-cards category/group styles in `index.css`: `.card-category`, `.character-group`, `.character-group-header`, `.character-group-content`, `.add-all-btn`.
  - Character Stacks subdivision search input uses `.character-stack-name-search` and intentionally matches `.character-name-search` styling.
  - Keep shared selector parity between `.character-name-search` and `.character-stack-name-search` to avoid UI drift.
  - Reference: [docs/current/STYLE_GUIDE.md](../../docs/current/STYLE_GUIDE.md) section "Deck Editor Available Cards Character Stacks".
- **Database View Special Cards columns (Icon, Value, Function)**:
  - Column order and widths (all in `database-view.css` `nth-child` rules): `14% | 9% | 15% | 13% | 21% | 8%(Icon) | 8%(Value) | 12%(Function)`.
  - **Icon column** styles:
    - Cell grid: `.special-power-icons-cell` — `display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 20px); gap: 4px; justify-content: center`.
    - Cell icon: `.special-power-type-icon` — fixed `20px × 20px`.
    - Text fallback: `.special-icon-text-fallback` — for icons without a PNG (e.g. Multi-Power).
    - Filter toggle grid: `.special-power-filter-toggles` — `display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 36px); gap: 6px`.
    - Toggle button: `.power-type-filter-toggle` — same `36px` square style as `.function-filter-toggle`; active: `.is-active`; disabled: `.is-disabled`.
    - "No Icon" label: `.special-no-icon-toggle-label` — same style as `.special-no-value-toggle-label`.
    - Outer wrapper: `.icon-filter-container` — `display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 6px`.
  - **Value filter** UI: `.column-filters` + `.filter-input.equals/.min/.max` and `.special-no-value-toggle-label`. Disabled state: `#special-cards-table .filter-input:disabled`.
  - **Function column** styles: `.special-function-filter-toggles` (2-col grid), `.function-filter-toggle` (36px square), `.special-function-icon` (32px).
  - Update [docs/current/STYLE_GUIDE.md](../../docs/current/STYLE_GUIDE.md) whenever any of these column/toggle visuals change.

## Mobile / `layout-mobile`

- **Roadmap and milestones:** [/MOBILE_DESIGN.md](../../MOBILE_DESIGN.md) (repo root). Breakpoint source of truth: **`--layout-mobile-max`** in `mobile-layout.css` (keep aligned with `layout-mode.js`). **DBV Characters tab** CSS regressions: [`tests/unit/layout-mode-and-viewport.test.ts`](../../tests/unit/layout-mode-and-viewport.test.ts) (`describe` **`mobile-layout.css (DBV Characters tab)`**); comments in `mobile-layout.css` by **`--dbv-mobile-tile-*`** and Characters **M2c** header point there.
- **Scope mobile-specific rules** under **`html.layout-mobile`** (or `.layout-mobile` descendant of `html` with class on root) in [`public/css/mobile-layout.css`](../css/mobile-layout.css). Avoid widening desktop tables for mobile—prefer stacked filters, scroll wrappers, or card-row patterns per `MOBILE_DESIGN.md`.
- **Global nav (M1 + refinements):** Under **`.layout-mobile`**, **`mobile-layout.css`** defines a **row** header (logo + **`.header-nav-cluster`**), **2×2** **`.header-app-actions`** grid, **`.user-menu-toggle`** **`flex-end`**, **half-width** account dropdown, logo column sizing, and **no top padding** on **`.unified-header`**. Desktop: **`.header-nav-cluster`** is **`display: contents`** in **`globalNav.css`**. Spec: [/MOBILE_DESIGN.md](../../MOBILE_DESIGN.md) **§10.1**; agent detail: [`public/components/.cursorrules`](../components/.cursorrules).
- **Touch targets:** Prefer **44px** minimum; utility class **`.touch-target-min`** in `mobile-layout.css` where individual controls are undersized.
- **DBV files:** `database-view.css`, `card-tables.css`; deck Card View: `deck-editor-card-view.css`. **M2c (done):** mobile DBV rules and Characters **card rows** in [`mobile-layout.css`](../css/mobile-layout.css); **`#characters-table tbody td:nth-child(n+3)`** hidden under **`.layout-mobile`** (name/stats — image + actions only). **`.layout-mobile #database-view`** defines **`--dbv-mobile-tile-img-max`** / **`--dbv-mobile-tile-img-landscape-max-h`**; overrides **All** tab **`.all-cards-cell`** image caps (desktop **`database-view.css`** stays **`200px`**). **`.characters-mobile-card-caption`** (mobile-only) under character art — **`.characters-mobile-card-caption__name`**, optional **`__ability`** (**`special_abilities`**), then **`__set`** (set / number). Character **`.card-image-container`**: mobile **flex** row (**prev | img | next**), **`width: 100%`**; **`img`** uses the same **`--dbv-mobile-tile-img-max`**, **`horizontal-card`** + landscape **`max-height`** token via **`applyDbvHorizontalCardClass`** in [`card-display.js`](../js/card-display.js); **`--with-nav`** still on DOM when alternate art exists. Character **`data-label`** + row height locks in **`card-display.js`**. Roadmap: `MOBILE_DESIGN.md`.
- **Characters filter row (mobile):** **`tr.characters-filter-row`** unified card (**`1fr`** grid). **`th.characters-filter-clear-th`** hidden; **`#clear-filters-mobile`** in **`.characters-filter-clear-inline`** (**right** of **`= / Min / Max`**; panels **`flex: 3`**, clear **`flex: 1`**). **Search abilities** **`th`** full width (same as name). **`characters-filter-spacer-th`** hidden. **Inherent** toggles hidden.
- **Characters tab stat filters:** Markup uses **`th.characters-stat-filters-th`** **`colspan="5"`** with **`.characters-stat-tablist`** (icon tabs) + **`.characters-stat-panels`** / **`.characters-stat-panel`** / **`.column-filters`**. **Desktop** (`html:not(.layout-mobile)` in `database-view.css`): tablist hidden; panels row with five vertical `.column-filters`. **Mobile** (`mobile-layout.css`): **file-folder** tabs; active **`.column-filters`** row: **`.equals`**, **`.min`**, **`.max`** all **`flex: 1 1 0`** (equal width). **`characters-stat-filter-tabs.js`**: tab clicks + `layout-mode-change`. Filter: **`card-filter-toggles.js`** `applyFilters`.
